      "id": "berklee-music-theory-book-1-p0012",
      "source_en": "2. Practice writing half rests in the measures provided, two per measure. Notice that the rest value is placed on the line and each is equally spaced in its own half of the measure.\n\n3. Practice writing quarter rests in the measures provided, four to a measure.\n\n4. Circle the correct measure.\n\n5. Add bar lines to make three measures of 4.\n\n6. Add bar lines to make four measures of 4.\n\n7. Add bar lines to make six measures of 4.",
